    "What does W2C mean, and how does it work with Kakobuy?":"W2C 是什么意思？如何配合 Kakobuy 使用？","W2C means “where to cop.” A W2C page helps you discover a source product on Taobao, Weidian, 1688 or Tmall. Copy that source URL, paste it into Kakobuy, then verify the seller, price, selected version, size, color and China domestic shipping before paying.":"W2C 是“去哪里买”的缩写，用于寻找淘宝、微店、1688 或天猫的商品源链接。复制源链接并粘贴到 Kakobuy 后，付款前应核对卖家、价格、版本、尺码、颜色和中国境内运费。",
    "Does Kakobuy provide free QC photos?":"Kakobuy 是否免费提供 QC 照片？","Standard warehouse QC images are generally part of the received-order workflow, but the number of included images and the current price of a special or additional photo can change. The order page shown after warehouse arrival is the source of truth. KakobuyLab deliberately does not publish a permanent “one extra photo costs X” claim without a stable official fee page.":"商品到达仓库后通常会进入标准 QC 拍照流程，但免费照片数量以及特殊角度或额外照片的价格可能变化。应以入库后的订单页面为准。在没有稳定官方价目表的情况下，KakobuyLab 不会把“补拍一张固定多少钱”写成永久价格。",
    "What should I ask for in one extra QC photo?":"补拍一张 QC 照片时应该拍什么？","Ask for one decisive angle or measurement: insole length beside a ruler, a close-up of a suspected stain, the rear alignment of both shoes, a care label, hardware engraving, or a bag laid flat with width measured. “Take more photos” wastes time; a precise instruction produces evidence you can actually use.":"应要求一个能直接影响决定的角度或尺寸，例如尺子旁的鞋垫长度、疑似污渍特写、两只鞋后跟对齐、洗标、五金刻字，或将包平放测量宽度。不要只说“多拍几张”，精确说明才能得到真正有用的证据。",
    "How much is Kakobuy shipping?":"Kakobuy 运费是多少？","There is no universal rate. Your final quote depends on destination, shipping line, actual weight, volumetric weight, item restrictions, parcel dimensions, optional insurance and current carrier pricing. Use our estimator only for planning, then compare eligible live routes in the Kakobuy parcel screen.":"没有统一运费。最终报价取决于目的地、物流线路、实际重量、体积重、商品限制、包裹尺寸、可选保险和承运商实时价格。本页估算器仅用于规划，最终应在 Kakobuy 包裹页面比较可用线路。",
    "Does Kakobuy charge a service fee?":"Kakobuy 收取服务费吗？","Kakobuy currently promotes “Pay Only €3 Per Parcel.” Treat that as a fee headline, not a promise that every other cost disappears. Product price, seller-to-warehouse shipping, international freight, optional services, payment conversion and possible tax or duty remain separate components.":"Kakobuy 当前宣传“每个包裹仅 €3”。这只是费用宣传，并不表示其他成本全部消失。商品价格、卖家到仓库运费、国际运费、可选服务、支付汇差以及可能产生的税费仍需单独计算。",
    "Is the $410 coupon a single discount?":"$410 优惠券是一张券吗？","The official site promotes a $410 new-user coupon bundle. A bundle normally means multiple vouchers with minimum-spend, route, timing or user-status conditions—not $410 taken from one ordinary parcel. Open the coupon wallet and check the threshold, expiry and eligible shipping line for each voucher.":"官网宣传的是价值 $410 的新用户优惠券包，通常由多张带有消费门槛、线路、时间或用户条件的券组成，并不是普通包裹直接减 $410。应在优惠券钱包中查看每张券的门槛、有效期和适用线路。",
    "Can I paste Taobao, Weidian, 1688 and Tmall links?":"可以粘贴淘宝、微店、1688 和天猫链接吗？","These are the main source-link types used in W2C shopping. Kakobuy may parse the page automatically or require manual order details. Always compare the parsed title, SKU image, color, size, quantity and price with the original page before submitting payment.":"这些都是 W2C 购物常用的商品源链接。Kakobuy 可能自动解析，也可能要求手动填写订单。付款前应将解析后的标题、SKU 图片、颜色、尺码、数量和价格与原页面逐项核对。",
    "Why can volumetric weight be higher than actual weight?":"为什么体积重可能高于实际重量？","Aircraft and trucks sell space as well as kilograms. A light but bulky shoebox may occupy more capacity than its scale weight suggests, so some lines use length × width × height divided by a route-specific divisor. Rehearsal packing, box removal and careful consolidation can reduce the measured volume.":"航空和陆运同时计算重量与占用空间。轻但体积大的鞋盒可能占用更多容量，因此部分线路使用长 × 宽 × 高再除以线路系数计算体积重。预打包、合理去盒和谨慎合箱可以降低体积。",
    "Are customs and taxes included in the shipping quote?":"运费报价包含关税和税费吗？","Sometimes a route is described as tax-free or duty-handled, while other routes leave import charges to the recipient. The answer depends on the destination and exact line. Read the live route description and declared-value rules rather than relying on a general social-media answer.":"部分线路会标注免税或包税，其他线路则可能由收件人承担进口费用。是否包含取决于目的地和具体线路，应阅读实时线路说明和申报规则，不要只依赖社交平台上的通用回答。",
    "Is KakobuyLab official, and does it sell products?":"KakobuyLab 是官网吗？会直接销售商品吗？","No. KakobuyLab is an independent research and discovery site created to organize product links and explain the buying workflow. Product links lead to KakobuyMake, while order completion and final policies belong to Kakobuy. We do not take product or shipping payments.":"不是。KakobuyLab 是独立的研究与商品发现网站，用于整理商品链接和解释购买流程。商品链接跳转 KakobuyMake，订单提交和最终政策以 Kakobuy 为准；本站不收取商品款或运费。",
