    "A repeatable inspection checklist for apparel, shoes, bags and accessories.": "Liosta seiceála athnuaite ar chlé, ar chlé, ar chnáit agus ar chlé.",
    "W2C · 11 min": "W2C · 11 nóiméad",
    "Kakobuy W2C: From Source Link to Warehouse": "Kakobuy W2C: Ó nasc foinse go stór",
    "Decode Taobao, Weidian, 1688 and Tmall links without losing the correct variant.": "Dé-chódáil Taobao, Weidian, 1688 agus Tmall naisc gan a chailleadh an leagan ceart.",
    "Shipping · 13 min": "Loingseoireacht · 13 nóiméad",
    "Kakobuy Shipping Cost, Coupons and Fees": "Costas Loingseoireachta Kakobuy, Cuipón agus Taillí",
    "Understand actual weight, volume, add-ons and why headline discounts can mislead.": "Tuigigh an meáchan, an méid, na breiseáin agus cén fáth gur féidir le díolacháin teideal a mhealladh.",
    "What does W2C mean, and how does it work with Kakobuy?": "Cad a chiallaíonn W2C, agus conas a oibríonn sé le Kakobuy?",
    "W2C means “where to cop.” A W2C page helps you discover a source product on Taobao, Weidian, 1688 or Tmall. Copy that source URL, paste it into Kakobuy, then verify the seller, price, selected version, size, color and China domestic shipping before paying.": "Is é an focal W2C a chiallaíonn  cá bhfuil tú ag copáil.” Cuidíonn leathanach W2C leat táirge foinse a fháil ar Taobao, Weidian, 1688 nó Tmall. Coipí an URL foinse sin, pasáil é i Kakobuy, ansin seiceáil an díoltóir, praghas, leagan roghnaithe, méid, dath agus loingseoireacht intíre na Síne sula n-íocann tú.",
    "Does Kakobuy provide free QC photos?": "An soláthraíonn Kakobuy grianghraif QC saor in aisce?",
    "Standard warehouse QC images are generally part of the received-order workflow, but the number of included images and the current price of a special or additional photo can change. The order page shown after warehouse arrival is the source of truth. KakobuyLab deliberately does not publish a permanent “one extra photo costs X” claim without a stable official fee page.": "Is cuid den phróiseas oibre atá ar fáil i gcónaí i gcúrsaí Ghluaisteachta agus Ghluaiseachta (Ghluaiseacht na Gaeilge) a bhaineann le pictiúir agus le pictiúir.",
    "What should I ask for in one extra QC photo?": "Cad ba cheart dom a iarraidh i gceann grianghraf breise QC?",
    "Ask for one decisive angle or measurement: insole length beside a ruler, a close-up of a suspected stain, the rear alignment of both shoes, a care label, hardware engraving, or a bag laid flat with width measured. “Take more photos” wastes time; a precise instruction produces evidence you can actually use.": "Iarr an t-alt nó an tomhas amháin a bheidh cinnte: fad na solais taobh thiar de ruler, scáth go luath ar stain amhrasach, an ailíníocht iar-aise ar an dá chlé, lipéad cúraim, grabháil crua-earraí, nó mála leagtha ar shráid le breis tomhar. Gáire níos mó grianghraf” ag caitheamh ama; tugann treoir cruinn fianaise is féidir leat a úsáid i ndáiríre.",
    "How much is Kakobuy shipping?": "Cé mhéad a dhéanann Kakobuy loingseoireacht?",
    "There is no universal rate. Your final quote depends on destination, shipping line, actual weight, volumetric weight, item restrictions, parcel dimensions, optional insurance and current carrier pricing. Use our estimator only for planning, then compare eligible live routes in the Kakobuy parcel screen.": "Níl aon ráta uilíoch ann. Braitheann do thoibriú deiridh ar thuras, líne loingseoireachta, meáchan fíor, meáchan tomhais, srianta earraí, tomhais pacáiste, árachas roghnach agus praghsanna reatha an iompair.",
    "Does Kakobuy charge a service fee?": "An bhfuil Kakobuy a ghearradh táille seirbhíse?",
    "Kakobuy currently promotes “Pay Only €3 Per Parcel.” Treat that as a fee headline, not a promise that every other cost disappears. Product price, seller-to-warehouse shipping, international freight, optional services, payment conversion and possible tax or duty remain separate components.": "Tá an t-airgead seo ar fáil don phobal, agus tá an t-airgead seo ar fáil go héifeachtach, agus tá an t-airgead seo ar fáil go héifeachtach.",
    "Is the $410 coupon a single discount?": "An bhfuil an coupon $410 ar lasaint amháin?",
    "The official site promotes a $410 new-user coupon bundle. A bundle normally means multiple vouchers with minimum-spend, route, timing or user-status conditions—not $410 taken from one ordinary parcel. Open the coupon wallet and check the threshold, expiry and eligible shipping line for each voucher.": "Tá pacáiste coupon nua-úsáideoirí $410 ar fáil ar an suíomh oifigiúil. Ciallaíonn pacáiste go ginearálta roinnt baincéirí le coinníollacha coiteann, bealach, am nó stádas úsáideora - ní $410 a thógtar ó phascal gnáth amháin. Oscail an cúpún póca agus seiceáil an teorainn, an scrúdú agus líne loingseoireachta incháilithe do gach baincéir.",
    "Can I paste Taobao, Weidian, 1688 and Tmall links?": "An féidir liom na naisc Taobao, Weidian, 1688 agus Tmall a phacáil?",
    "These are the main source-link types used in W2C shopping. Kakobuy may parse the page automatically or require manual order details. Always compare the parsed title, SKU image, color, size, quantity and price with the original page before submitting payment.": "Is iad seo na príomh-típeanna nasc foinse a úsáidtear i siopa W2C. Is féidir le Kakobuy an leathanach a phlé go huathoibríoch nó sonraí ordú lámhaigh a cheangal. Déan comparáid i gcónaí leis an teideal phlé, íomhá SKU, dath, méid, méid, méid agus praghas leis an leathanach bunaidh sula gcuireann tú íocaíocht isteach.",
    "Why can volumetric weight be higher than actual weight?": "Cén fáth go bhféadfadh meáchan volumetric a bheith níos airde ná meáchan fíor?",
    "Aircraft and trucks sell space as well as kilograms. A light but bulky shoebox may occupy more capacity than its scale weight suggests, so some lines use length × width × height divided by a route-specific divisor. Rehearsal packing, box removal and careful consolidation can reduce the measured volume.": "Tá an t-airgead seo ar fáil do na daoine a bhfuil an t-airgead acu a bheith ag baint úsáide as an t-airgead a bhaineann le ceallraí a phlé.",
    "Are customs and taxes included in the shipping quote?": "An bhfuil custaim agus cánacha san áireamh sa t-airgead loingseoireachta?",
    "Sometimes a route is described as tax-free or duty-handled, while other routes leave import charges to the recipient. The answer depends on the destination and exact line. Read the live route description and declared-value rules rather than relying on a general social-media answer.": "Is minic a thuairiscítear ar thuras mar shaor insteolas nó faoi chustaim, agus tá tá táillí allmhairithe ar fáil don fhaighteoir ar thuras eile. Braitheann an freagra ar an gceann scríbe agus ar an líne cruinn. Léigh an tuairisceán ar an mbealach beo agus rialacha luach dearbhú seachas brath ar fhreagairt ginearálta ar na meáin shóisialta.",
    "Is KakobuyLab official, and does it sell products?": "An bhfuil KakobuyLab oifigiúil, agus an díolann sé táirgí?",
    "No. KakobuyLab is an independent research and discovery site created to organize product links and explain the buying workflow. Product links lead to KakobuyMake, while order completion and final policies belong to Kakobuy. We do not take product or shipping payments.": "Níl. Is suíomh taighde agus foilsithe neamhspleách é KakobuyLab a cruthaíodh chun nasc táirgí a eagrú agus an sruth oibre ceannaigh a mhíniú.",
    "Found the right link?": "Fuair an nasc ceart?",
